				<div class="cell">
					<div class="figure">37%</div>
					<div class="caption">faster TF pipelines</div>
					<div class="note">8:52 → 5:36 fleet-wide via cache-key fix + Modern Terraform CI/CD</div>
				</div>
				<div class="cell">
