					<div class="ej-work-body">
						<div class="ej-work-title">
							Terraform GitLab Runner module <em>— scale-to-zero on AWS</em>
						</div>
						<p class="ej-work-blurb">
							Self-authored Terraform module powering self-service GitLab runner fleets:
							100% Spot, attribute-based instance selection, Fleeting plugin for the
							Docker Autoscaler executor, multi-arch. The module that runs the entire
							Zencity CI fleet — and 3,767 downloads says other organisations had the
							same problem.
						</p>
						<div class="ej-work-meta">
							<span class="chip signal">3,767 downloads</span>
							<span class="chip">Terraform Registry</span>
							<span class="chip">v0.6.8</span>
