				<a class="ej-work" href="/projects/devops-claude-skills/">
					<div class="ej-work-no">№ 02</div>
					<div class="ej-work-body">
						<div class="ej-work-title">
							DevOps Claude Skills <em>— a marketplace, not a one-off</em>
						</div>
						<p class="ej-work-blurb">
							Curated Claude Code skills for DevOps workflows: ArgoCD cluster onboarding
							via Pod Identity + AssumeRole, AWS SSO auth recovery, Terraform → ArgoCD
							migration, k8s triage, FinOps. Real community traction in 7 months.
						</p>
						<div class="ej-work-meta">
							<span class="chip signal">158 ★ · 32 forks</span>
							<span class="chip">Claude Code</span>
							<span class="chip">10+ skills</span>
