							Kyverno fleet rollout <em>— policy-as-code on every cluster</em>
						</div>
						<p class="ej-work-blurb">
							Auto-PDB ClusterPolicy on every multi-replica Deployment fleet-wide.
							Observation-VPA generation via a separate-by-kind rule design. CRD
							drift suppression for ArgoCD. Migrated from Terraform Helm onto an
							ApplicationSet — 19 commits in <code>zc-gitops</code>.
						</p>
						<div class="ej-work-meta">
							<span class="chip signal">Fleet-wide Sep 2025</span>
