						</div>
						<p class="ej-work-blurb">
							Crossplane v2.5.3 (Upbound) bootstrapped on the shared devops
							clusters in Pipeline mode. The first usable Composition —
							<code>AppWorkloadBucket</code> with S3 versioning + lifecycle + CORS
							— shipped to prod. Declarative AWS resources reconciled by k8s
							controllers instead of <code>terraform apply</code>.
						</p>
